     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Accept: A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands! is offered in Orgrimmar, Undercity and Thunder Bluff; take one.",
       "kind": "warn"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "actions": [
    {
     "type": "goto",
     "at": {
      "mapId": 1454,
      "x": 37.6,
      "y": 75.4,
      "zone": "Orgrimmar",
      "exact": true
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "accept",
     "questId": 5093,
     "label": "A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!"
    }
   ],
   "conditions": [],
   "routes": [
    "balanced",
    "speedrun"
   ],
   "tips": [
    {
     "kind": "general",
     "text": "Set your hearth in Undercity before the Bulwark if you have not already.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "url": "https://github.com/Questie/QuestieDB/releases/tag/v1.1.3",
       "label": "QuestieDB v1.1.3 Forever release (pinned PR #5, commit 8b8df2d)"
      },
      {
       "url": "https://github.com/liviu-stefan-pit/project-forever/blob/0b16829/content/questie-db/README.md",
       "label": "project-forever QuestieDB import (PR #5, content/questie-db)"
      }
     ],
     "verified": true
    },
    {
     "kind": "speed",
     "text": "The Bulwark's cauldron chain moves you through the fields in a fixed order; follow it and kill everything on the path.",
     "routes": [
      "speedrun"
     ],
     "sources": [
      {
       "url": "https://github.com/Questie/QuestieDB/tree/master/data/Forever",
       "label": "QuestieDB data/Forever (GPL-3.0)"
      }
     ],
     "verified": true
    },
    {
     "kind": "general",
     "text": "Most mobs here are undead. Paladins: Exorcism and Holy Wrath hit them hard and Seal of Command procs often. Undead Paladins can Cannibalize on the corpses.",
     "classes": [
      "Paladin"
     ],
     "sources": [
      {
       "url": "https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Class",
       "label": "Warcraft Wiki: Classes"
      }
     ],
     "verified": false
    },
    {
     "kind": "general",
     "text": "Priests can Shackle Undead the extra mob in a pull; Shadow Word: Pain still works on undead.",
     "classes": [
      "Priest"
     ],
     "sources": [
      {
       "url": "https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Class",
       "label": "Warcraft Wiki: Classes"
      }
     ],
     "verified": false
    },
    {
     "kind": "general",
     "text": "Abandon quests you are not about to turn in before you fly from Kalimdor to the Plaguelands. The quest log holds 40.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "url": "https://github.com/Questie/QuestieDB/releases/tag/v1.1.3",
       "label": "QuestieDB v1.1.3 Forever release (pinned PR #5, commit 8b8df2d)"
